                      "id": "UzQIC",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 每张是一个卡片：内边距 8、卡片圆角 16、图片圆角 8（radius）；图片正方形 cover 裁切；灯箱中显示完整原图",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
