                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 平时彩色；鼠标移入组图后变为灰度 + 压暗 12%，光标处半径 260px 的柔边聚光恢复彩色并平滑跟随（damping 0.45），离开后 0.6s 淡回彩色",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
