                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "f6kWL",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 中间用 React Bits DepthCarousel（依赖 gsap）：当前图在最前，后面的图向右后方层层退远、变暗、模糊、倾斜 22°（设计稿画不出倾斜）；scrim 底（亮暗主题一致）",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wRvfL",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 卡片高度 = 视口高度 − 180px（最高 760；1440×900 时 720），手机卡片宽 330（屏宽 − 60）；宽度按每张图原始比例（需改源码），不裁切；动态照片在最前的卡片上显示 LiveBadge，悬停 / 长按 / 按住空格播放",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wt2Zx",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 桌面：DepthCarousel 自带左右箭头（42px）、← → 切换、滚轮 / 拖拽切换，点后面的卡片跳到该张；不循环，首末张箭头禁用；Esc 或点空白处关闭",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "clqWF",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 手机：左右拖动切换（不显示箭头），下滑超过 120px 关闭（随手指淡出）；不支持双指缩放 / 双击放大（与 3D 层叠冲突）",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kGemr",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 打开时锁定页面滚动，焦点移到卡片区（可直接用方向键）；关闭后焦点回到原图片（role=\"dialog\"，aria-modal）",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "R5qmr",
                      "name": "Note Line",
                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "· 打开 / 关闭：0.2s 淡入淡出，直接定位到点击的那张（不播放切换动画）；prefers-reduced-motion 时切换无动画",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "r2ObzS",
